    <statement><p>Compute the divergence of the vector field:</p>
<p><me>\mathbf{F} = \left\lt  7x-2zx^{6},7z-xy,z^{2}x^{2}\right&gt;</me>
<m>\text{div} (\mathbf{F}) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>7-12zx^{5}-x+2zx^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>\text{div} (\mathbf{F}) =\frac{\partial }{\partial x}(7x-2zx^{6})+\frac{\partial }{\partial y}(7z-xy)+\frac{\partial }{\partial z}(z^{2}x^{2})=</me><me>(7-12zx^{5})+(-x)+(2zx^{2})=7-12zx^{5}-x+2zx^{2}</me>


</solution>
